      "height": 165,
      "text": "1   You pick a mode, give a story (typed, from ClickUp, or a .md file), choose a model and click Generate\n2   The server wraps the story in expert QA instructions and asks the AI for structured JSON\n3   It sends the request to the AI provider you picked, using that provider's API key from .env\n4   The AI answers with test cases (or one bug report), plus how many tokens it used\n5   The server sends the result back to your browser\n6   You review it as Formatted / Table / Raw JSON and export it as JSON, Markdown or CSV",
      "originalText": "1   You pick a mode, give a story (typed, from ClickUp, or a .md file), choose a model and click Generate\n2   The server wraps the story in expert QA instructions and asks the AI for structured JSON\n3   It sends the request to the AI provider you picked, using that provider's API key from .env\n4   The AI answers with test cases (or one bug report), plus how many tokens it used\n5   The server sends the result back to your browser\n6   You review it as Formatted / Table / Raw JSON and export it as JSON, Markdown or CSV",
